{"steam_appid":1721170,"steam_name":"What Lies in the Multiverse","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1721170/448989/58baec4e2a6462c066b481cf92b3e9e52514e580/1751023672/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1683711812","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256878955/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1683711812","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/ss_bd4be9084f4cc501bc7b0e9c3e593a43fca53cea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774632238","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/ss_a71e2443c4ff52a35ead2630636d71965a71815e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774632238","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/ss_cf996fe426b93e63af0d07f636abaf2030a61cf2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774632238","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/ss_874d32ce054ed9171b9f2e0b8ae5beea35f5e152.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774632238","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/ss_6dc392c5d2da834ef71ed0f0f7da7d456b85edee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774632238"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/0255b35294f8702cc756becaa2586105.avif?t=1774632238\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>What Lies in the Multiverse is a story-driven puzzle platformer filled to the brim with hijinks, chaos, and reality-bending adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seamless Transformations</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.poster.avif?t=1774632238\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.webm?t=1774632238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.mp4?t=1774632238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Harness the power of the multiverse! Switch worlds in mid-air, turning pitfalls into bridges, walls into tunnels, and foes into friends. Just be careful when you mess around with gravity…<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse World</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.poster.avif?t=1774632238\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.webm?t=1774632238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.mp4?t=1774632238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a journey across gorgeous pixel-art worlds, each with a unique parallel reality you can dive into at will. Explore temples, towns, harbors, the wilderness and more as you race to unlock the secrets of the Multiverse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful Cast of Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.poster.avif?t=1774632238\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.webm?t=1774632238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.mp4?t=1774632238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Meet a vast cast of quirky characters: mad scientists, secret agents, sweet old ladies, enlightened monks, and a charismatic, reality-hopping genius named Everett, who promises to take you on a whirlwind adventure and is definitely telling you the whole truth about himself, yes siree, nothing suspicious there at all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Deeper Story</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.poster.avif?t=1774632238\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.webm?t=1774632238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.mp4?t=1774632238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A light-hearted but emotionally nuanced story that delves into the darker side of human nature. <br><br><i>“Okay kid, time to go. You gave me enough trouble already and this whole mess won’t fix itself…”</i>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Intel Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 750M, 2 GB Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 8.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Studio Voyager","IguanaBee"],"publishers":["Untold Tales","Doyoyo Games"],"release_date":"4 Mar, 2022"}